\newlabel{fig:psweep}{{4}{6}{\textbf {Per-iteration convergence on the Rosenbrock-NLE $p$-sweep.} \AGNS -Lookahead (magenta) is the fastest method on every panel. Plain gradient and FISTA (gray, black) diverge cleanly at $p\geq 6$. Horizontal axis truncated at $200$ iterations for readability}{figure.caption.9}{}}
