\newlabel{fig:appendix_lse}{{5}{6}{\textbf {LogSumExp on real LIBSVM data} (a9a, mushrooms; $\mu =0.1$). The benchmark where \AGNS \ does \emph {not} accelerate convergence; \GNS -Exact already attains quadratic local convergence and reaches the target in $18$ and $24$ iterations respectively, fewer than \AGNS -Lookahead's $40$ and $57$}{figure.caption.10}{}}
